      "content": "that makes sense, thanks for catching that. i just want to be 100% sure for the audit trail. if we had to explain this depreciation process to someone who isn't an accountant, how would you describe the concept of value being \"lost\" or \"worn down\" over the years? just looking for a simple way to explain why the asset is losing value like this.",
